{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00356","headline":"玄都观 · 蜀太后徐氏","name":"玄都观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千寻绿嶂夹流溪，登眺因知海岳低。\n瀑布迸舂青石碎，轮茵横翦翠峰齐。\n步黏苔藓龙桥滑，日闭烟罗鸟径迷。\n莫道穹天无路到，此山便是碧云梯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蜀太后徐氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}